WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.135
-President Trump's
attempted coup

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.837
keeps getting dumber
and more desperate.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.439
Today his lawyer,
Rudy Giuliani,

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.441
had a meltdown
live on television

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:11.511
as Trump tried to overturn the
will of the voters in Michigan.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.013
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:17.717
♪♪

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.720
Let's start with some good news,
because God knows we need it.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.122
For the last few weeks,
I've been popping Ativan

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:25.157
like they're Altoids.
Although in fairness,

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:27.694
they shouldn't sell them
in similar-looking tins.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.963
Early data suggests we may have
not one but two

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:33.199
highly effective
coronavirus vaccines,

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.501
and in particular,
Pfizer says they're ready to ask

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.571
the FDA for emergency use
authorization within days.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.073
Meanwhile tonight,
Oxford and AstraZeneca

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:43.743
reported their vaccine
has generated a strong

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.612
immune response
in older adults.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.847
Honestly, I'm so ready
for this vaccine,

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.948
I've been showing up to
my local CVS in a tank top

00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:52.418
waiting for a shot in my arm.
My pharmacist told me,

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:55.255
"You look like 'Late Night'
writer Mike Scollins."

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:02.395
Yeah, this burn also is going to
have multiple waves, Scollins.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.764
Anyway, doctors and public
health officials who have been

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.066
extremely cautious throughout
this entire pandemic

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:10.002
are starting to tell us there
really are glimmers of hope.

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:12.171
We just have to pull together
and get through what will

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:14.240
undoubtedly be a brutal winner.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.075
-The end is actually in sight

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.810
with these two promising
vaccines.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.478
We just have to get through
this winter.

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:20.980
We can do it.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.482
We can put off celebrating
Thanksgiving in person.

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:25.417
Let's have Thanksgiving
in July.

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:26.685
-Great, I love that idea.

00:01:26.685 --> 00:01:28.321
Thanksgiving sucks
where it is now.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.822
It's too close to Christmas.

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:32.392
We don't need back-to-back
holidays where we go home

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.693
and sleep on a twin bed
after mainlining gravy.

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:37.196
Move it to July
and we can stuff a bird

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.966
full of bottle rockets and
launch it straight into the sky,

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.435
aka, Fire Turks.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.837
The writer of this piece,
Sal Gentile, wanted me to stress

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:46.839
that Fire Turks was not
in his original draft

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.274
and that I added
it a after the fact.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.943
And I don't care.
I'll own it.

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.945
However, Sal did write
that Scollins burn

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:55.181
and he wasn't even
in the original Zoom meeting

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.682
when Scollins wore
the tank top.

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.551
That's how ridiculous
you look, Mike.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.754
He heard it secondhand
and he's burning you.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.255
Anyway, we can combine
the traditions

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:04.923
of both holidays
into one.

00:02:04.923 --> 00:02:07.059
Gravy on our hot dogs,
cranberries on our hamburgers,

00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:09.362
and instead of football,
we can fall asleep on the couch

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.497
watching the Detroit Lions
lose at Wimbledon.

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.599
I'm sorry, why is it the Lions
every year?

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.200
Because tradition.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.036
We just need to get through
this bleak winter,

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.771
but we also need a plan
for rolling out

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.306
a potential vaccine.

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.674
We're supposed to be
in the middle

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.809
of a presidential
transition right now,

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:26.946
which means we need the incoming
and outgoing administrations

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:30.250
to cooperate on developing a
plan to distribute the vaccine,

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.251
which Biden has called for.

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:35.454
-Getting the vaccine
and a vaccination, though,

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.156
are two different things.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:40.360
Everyone on our call today,
in our Zoom today,

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.495
agreed that the sooner
we have access to

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.631
the administration's
distribution plan,

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:49.034
the sooner this transition
would be smoothly move forward.

00:02:49.034 --> 00:02:50.736
-Ah, Joe Biden.

00:02:50.736 --> 00:02:53.639
It's like the human
"Sounds of the Rain Forest" CD.

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:57.376
Just hearing a president-elect
speak in direct, coherent terms

00:02:57.376 --> 00:03:00.446
about his plans for, you know,
solving things is reassuring.

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:03.482
Although Joe Biden could think
vaccine is the name of that lady

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:05.852
from the Hallmark cards
and I'd still just be glad

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.521
that I don't have to listen to
President Trump ever again.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.923
Huh. That's a funny one.

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:14.226
"How about instead of a shot
in the arm,

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:15.661
I gave you a shot in the ass."

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.463
Maxine!

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.333
Max, when will it stop,
Maxine?

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.668
And yet Donald Trump is still
moping around the White House

00:03:22.668 --> 00:03:25.338
pretending he has a path
to victory by, for example,

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.972
overturning the results
in Michigan.

00:03:26.972 --> 00:03:29.575
Trump tried to steal Michigan
in part by undermining

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:32.177
the routine process of
certifying election results

00:03:32.177 --> 00:03:34.380
in Wayne County, Michigan,
which he lost,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.216
and not coincidentally
includes Detroit.

00:03:37.216 --> 00:03:39.118
In fact, we learned today
he even went so far as to

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:41.821
personally call two local
Republican canvassers

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.423
in Wayne County, who then tried
to rescind their votes

00:03:44.423 --> 00:03:45.958
to certify the results.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.360
-Two members of the
Wayne County Board of Canvassers

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.096
suddenly changed course.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.965
-Yes, a pair of Republicans
trying it reverse course

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:56.301
after certifying the results
from the presidential election.

00:03:56.301 --> 00:03:59.572
-The very latest is that
the two Republican members

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:04.243
of the Board of Canvassers there
now asking for their votes

00:04:04.243 --> 00:04:07.346
to be rescinded from
earlier in the week,

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:10.350
and we are now learning
that President Donald Trump

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.252
actually called both of them

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:14.553
following that
controversial meeting.

00:04:14.553 --> 00:04:16.289
-So now Trump is trying
to interfere with

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:18.123
local county election boards.
What's next?

00:04:18.123 --> 00:04:20.326
Is he going to start
individually tracking down

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.061
