the "I Voted" sticker?

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:26.366
"I never got a sticker,
that's fraud. I win.

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.534
Now gimme that quilt,
you old bag!"

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.103
Also, this means someone at
the White House actually had to

00:04:31.103 --> 00:04:33.806
sift through Google or shuffle
through an old Rolodex

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:37.209
to find the phone numbers of two
local election canvassers

00:04:37.209 --> 00:04:39.011
in Wayne County, Michigan.

00:04:39.011 --> 00:04:40.713
You know how much time
that probably took?

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:44.083
Just to find this story about
Trump calling the canvassers,

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.552
I had to Google "Trump Wayne,"
and it gave me

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.554
a bunch of articles about
Lil Wayne supporting Trump,

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:50.990
so then I typed in "Wayne Trump"
into Google again,

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.592
and one of them suggested
searches was Wayne Trump,

00:04:53.592 --> 00:04:55.528
so I clicked on that
and found a Wikipedia article

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:57.496
about a jazz musician named
Wayne Bergeron

00:04:57.496 --> 00:04:59.432
who plays the trumpet,
so I started reading it

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:01.000
because I personally always
thought if I hadn't

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.135
gone into comedy, I could
have become a jazz musician.

00:05:03.135 --> 00:05:05.104
And then I remembered what I was
supposed to be doing and Googled

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:06.906
"Trump calls Wayne County
Board of Canvassers."

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.742
The point is, this stupid coup
is taking a long [bleep] time.

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:12.244
And then there's the fact that
Trump is attempting to overturn

00:05:12.244 --> 00:05:14.847
tens of thousands of ballots
in Georgia and Arizona

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:17.583
and sending Rudy Giuliani
to Pennsylvania

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:19.519
to embarrass himself
in federal court.

00:05:19.519 --> 00:05:21.787
It's funny, but when Rudy
shows up in court

00:05:21.787 --> 00:05:24.590
even via conference call,
everyone must immediately

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.259
think it's
a hidden camera prank.

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:29.128
When you think about it, in
every case but one this year,

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:32.231
Rudy was the Borat.

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:34.366
Rudy and the Trump team made
a series of court filings

00:05:34.366 --> 00:05:36.702
yesterday in which they asked,
and this is real,

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:39.771
to disenfranchise up to
1.5 million voters.

00:05:39.771 --> 00:05:42.341
They told the court that,
"Ultimately, plaintiffs

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:45.144
will seek the remedy of Trump
being declared the winner

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:47.680
of the legal votes cast
in the Pennsylvania

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.683
2020 general election,
and, thus,

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:53.319
the recipient of Pennsylvania's
electors."

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:55.254
Okay, sure.
Then I'm filing a motion

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:57.556
in court to seek the remedy that
Seth Meyers be named

00:05:57.556 --> 00:05:59.558
"People Magazine's
Sexiest Man Alive."

00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:01.560
And to my publicist, no,
I don't think

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.297
"Smug Weekly's Mug of the Month"
is just as good.

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:05.831
Anyway, Rudy and his legal team,

00:06:05.831 --> 00:06:07.332
which includes
a radio show host,

00:06:07.332 --> 00:06:10.836
are not just asking for millions
of voters to be disenfranchised,

00:06:10.836 --> 00:06:13.505
they're also asking,
and again, this is real,

00:06:13.505 --> 00:06:17.342
to be allowed to count
the ballots themselves.

00:06:17.342 --> 00:06:20.379
By the way, I'm using
"legal team" so loosely here.

00:06:20.379 --> 00:06:22.681
Anyway, Rudy's psycho plan
as far as I can tell

00:06:22.681 --> 00:06:25.384
is to count a sample
of the ballots and then

00:06:25.384 --> 00:06:28.387
if they can find enough supposed
fraud, which doesn't exist,

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:31.390
they will then extrapolate that
to all of the ballots

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.158
and declare Trump
the winner.

00:06:33.158 --> 00:06:35.761
According to the very real
and insane court filing,

00:06:35.761 --> 00:06:38.097
"Plaintiffs will examine these
envelopes to determine

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:40.433
the percentage of mail ballots
which were illegally counted.

00:06:40.433 --> 00:06:43.936
Plaintiffs, through statistical
expert analysis, will then

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:47.539
extrapolate this percent to
the 1.5 million mail ballots.

00:06:47.539 --> 00:06:50.143
This simple exercise will
determine whether plaintiffs

00:06:50.143 --> 00:06:52.645
can prove their case
that sufficient

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:53.980
illegal ballots were counted

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.748
that changed the result
of the election.

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:58.017
If so, the court should
set aside the votes

00:06:58.017 --> 00:06:59.485
and declare Trump the winner."

00:06:59.485 --> 00:07:01.654
I love the part where they say
they'll extrapolate

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:03.622
through statistical
expert analysis.

00:07:03.622 --> 00:07:05.457
I'm guessing what they mean
is Rudy's gonna be

00:07:05.457 --> 00:07:08.094
sitting in a room with an '80s
Casio printing calculator

00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:09.695
and a stack of ballots
trying to figure out

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:11.197
how to do higher order math.

00:07:11.197 --> 00:07:13.899
"What? I didn't know
square had roots!"

00:07:13.899 --> 00:07:16.468
Also, I'm glad they took time to
say that part of their petition

00:07:16.468 --> 00:07:18.737
is to prove
the plaintiff's case,

00:07:18.737 --> 00:07:20.973
which without exception
