00:07:39.057 --> 00:07:42.161
-I'm still a little concerned
about the use of Rudy Giuliani.

00:07:42.161 --> 00:07:45.865
They're not using the most
well-noted election lawyers.

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:48.801
There are folks who use --
who do this all of the time.

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:50.469
-Yeah, and none of them
want to be a part

00:07:50.469 --> 00:07:52.004
