00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:59.011
The raft in "Cast Away" wasn't
Tom Hanks' first choice of boat.

00:07:59.011 --> 00:08:00.479
It was his only choice.

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:02.715
Trump chose Rudy
the way you choose a dentist

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:05.017
