00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:18.430
Anyway, what we here
at "Late Night"

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.933 line:0%
have been calling
the Kooky Cuckoo Coup Crew

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:23.535 line:0%
