Then today, after a string of
embarrassing court losses

00:10:16.882 --> 00:10:20.118
and bumbling performances
in front of exasperated judges,

00:10:20.118 --> 00:10:22.988
Rudy Giuliani, voted
"America's wettest lawyer"

00:10:22.988 --> 00:10:24.923
for three years running,

00:10:24.923 --> 00:10:27.959
held a marathon press
conference/performance art piece

00:10:27.959 --> 00:10:30.662
that was honestly at times
so incomprehensible

00:10:30.662 --> 00:10:32.832
I thought had to put on
the closed captioning,

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:35.368 line:0%
and even when I did,
the closed captioning said,

00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:37.636 line:0%
"Your guess is as good as mine!"

00:10:37.636 --> 00:10:40.005
It would be impossible
and honestly pointless

00:10:40.005 --> 00:10:42.642
to wade through all
the unintelligible bull [bleep]

00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:44.176
because even if you were
somehow steeped

00:10:44.176 --> 00:10:46.512
in the Fox News
Cinematic Universe,

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:49.348
following all the details
of a deranged conspiracy theory

00:10:49.348 --> 00:10:50.883
like this can be exhausting.

00:10:50.883 --> 00:10:53.285
It's like keeping track
of where every character

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:55.621
is supposed to be be
during each Avengers movie.

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:57.089
All I know is I'm pretty sure

00:10:57.089 --> 00:10:59.258
Joe Biden is
old Captain America.

00:10:59.258 --> 00:11:01.960
Here's a sampling
of just how psychotic

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.963
this televised therapy
session was.

00:11:03.963 --> 00:11:06.198
-The only thing left
is the vote.

00:11:06.198 --> 00:11:08.433
That could have been
Mickey Mouse.

00:11:08.433 --> 00:11:09.969
That could have been
a dead person.

00:11:09.969 --> 00:11:12.070
Did you all watch
"My Cousin Vinny"?

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:14.440
You know the movie?
It's one of my favorite

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.343
law movies because he comes
from Brooklyn.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:21.147
And when the nice lady
who said she saw,

00:11:21.147 --> 00:11:24.149
and then he says to her,
"How many fingers do I --

00:11:24.149 --> 00:11:25.751
How many fingers do I got up?"

00:11:25.751 --> 00:11:28.186
A lot of people were coming over
from Camden to vote.

00:11:28.186 --> 00:11:30.388
They do every year.

00:11:30.388 --> 00:11:32.158
Happens all the time in Philly.

00:11:32.158 --> 00:11:34.025
It's about as frequent
as getting beaten up

00:11:34.025 --> 00:11:36.995
at a Philadelphia Eagle
basketball -- football game.

00:11:36.995 --> 00:11:42.000
I assume if she's working --
if she's working for the --

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.202
I assume if she's working
for the city of Detroit

00:11:44.202 --> 00:11:45.604
that she's a Democrat.

00:11:45.604 --> 00:11:47.906
-We have witnesses who have
actually reported --

00:11:47.906 --> 00:11:49.741
-Where are you, FBI?

00:11:49.741 --> 00:11:52.411
We more than double the number

00:11:52.411 --> 00:11:54.013
of votes needed to overturn
the election.

00:11:54.013 --> 00:11:57.550
There's nobody here that engages
in fantasies.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.286
-"How come nobody's
looking at my pencils?

00:12:02.354 --> 00:12:04.056
I got all the pencils!"

00:12:09.728 --> 00:12:11.563
[ Laughter ]

00:12:11.563 --> 00:12:14.566
I'm sorry, nobody here
engages in fantasies?

00:12:14.566 --> 00:12:17.436
You just did a lengthy
reenactment of "My Cousin Vinny"

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:19.605
and called the Philadelphia
Eagles a basketball team.

00:12:19.605 --> 00:12:22.174
Also, why is Rudy always
wiping his entire face

00:12:22.174 --> 00:12:23.843
like he just got done
doing CrossFit

00:12:23.843 --> 00:12:25.477
while eating a meatball sub?

00:12:25.477 --> 00:12:26.945
It's not great when the lawyer

00:12:26.945 --> 00:12:29.115
looks like he's about
to admit to the crime.

00:12:29.115 --> 00:12:31.149
"My client is innocent,
Your Honor,

00:12:31.149 --> 00:12:33.352
because I'm the killer
and I'd do it again!"

00:12:33.352 --> 00:12:36.255
Also, he admitted they're trying
to overturn the election.

00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:37.723
He actually used those words.

00:12:37.723 --> 00:12:39.991
It's like walking into
a costume shop and saying,

00:12:39.991 --> 00:12:41.927
"Which mask is best
for robbing a bank?"

00:12:41.927 --> 00:12:44.964
And, by the way, that's exactly
what they're trying to do.

00:12:44.964 --> 00:12:47.967
And it's very real.
And as incompetent as it is,

00:12:47.967 --> 00:12:50.335
it's still an assault on
Constitutional democracy.

00:12:50.335 --> 00:12:52.671
The President just invited
Michigan lawmakers to come

00:12:52.671 --> 00:12:54.640
to the White House to pressure
them to overturn

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.341
the results in their state.

00:12:56.341 --> 00:12:58.811
Can we just call this
an attempted coup now?

00:12:58.811 --> 00:13:01.147
Because that's what it is.
We're all arguing over

00:13:01.147 --> 00:13:04.049
terminology like whether it's
champagne or sparkling wine,

00:13:04.049 --> 00:13:05.617
but its a coup.

00:13:05.617 --> 00:13:08.020
Even if it doesn't succeed
because everybody involved

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.189
is a moron, that doesn't make it
any less horrifying.

00:13:10.189 --> 00:13:12.791
Even if this fails, historians
will spend years

00:13:12.791 --> 00:13:15.728
studying this attempted coup,
and psychiatrists

00:13:15.728 --> 00:13:17.229
will spend years studying...

00:13:17.229 --> 00:13:18.731
-The use of Rudy Giuliani.

00:13:18.731 --> 00:13:20.566
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

